{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game you will be landed in strange territories to explore, gathering resources, using resources to spawn constructions, weapons, characters, also you can possess and control them, try and experience a lot of abilities about magic, technology, ancient\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three maps to explore, level up characters, play combat mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Building your base by using resources, spawn many classes of characters and control many different kinds of characters against the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529820/extras/Uworld_image_3.png?t=1746106627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each class like champion, guard, weapon. When you claim them you can control and level up the character by using the ability of that character. With each level gained the ability cooldown of the character will be reduced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529820/extras/Uworld_image_1.png?t=1746106627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Special features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By pressing a keyboard button the character can auto move. You don\u2019t need to hold the button to move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play many different kinds of characters by swapping between characters anytime.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529820/extras/Uworld_image_2.png?t=1746106627\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529820?t=1746106627","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529820?t=1746106627","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a